WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:05.200
F1.1 · One system of record for FP&A, Cash and Build

2
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:10.600
Most finance teams run on a ledger, a few bank portals, and many spreadsheets.

3
00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:16.800
The logic that matters often lives in those spreadsheets, outside any system.

4
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:23.800
K-φ brings that work into one system of record.

5
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.800
FP&A for the ledger and the plan. Cash for banks and invoices. Build for your own logic.

6
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:37.000
A figure is imported once and reused everywhere.

7
00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:42.800
So the P&L, the cash forecast and your extension always agree.

8
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:49.000
In the app, the three workspaces are one click apart.

9
00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:54.800
Switch workspaces with the tabs at the top of the left panel.

10
00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:01.800
Custom logic belongs inside the system that holds the data.

11
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:06.800
Next: F1.2, a tour of the interface.

